  "status": "IN_PROGRESS",
  "document": "A39478",
  "range": {
    "first": "A39478-zh-00001",
    "last": "A39478-zh-00024"
  },
  "checked_rows": 24,
  "corrected_rows": 23,
  "source_ko_blob_sha": "cf045f80edc2f938db0d4fe8220fd7d22754c72b",
  "source_zh_blob_sha": "6aba81b8dd9749b92f915ab8a9faf4b1d2cd399c",
  "edits": [
    {
      "id": "A39478-zh-00001",
      "source_hash": "a013f4187a45e272a441f7bff2bf460b227a4e6a2c6d75f350c49cdd94e59ea2",
      "text": "■ 《防止人口贩运等及保护受害者等法施行令》〔附表五〕"
    },
    {
      "id": "A39478-zh-00003",
      "source_hash": "a617cf3ccc65ba6af0228b05b78c02b61364dbd74e669da8ea55dab0e5a320b6",
      "text": "1. 一般标准"
    },
    {
      "id": "A39478-zh-00004",
      "source_hash": "753a793eb97b552e74f397230259f0881e66fa480f87f04afb7f4bf45909c93b",
      "text": "甲. 按违法行为次数加重行政处分的标准，适用于最近三年内因相同违法"
    },
    {
      "id": "A39478-zh-00005",
      "source_hash": "8736c704ed0012a57485d47e4f849c5b34af1a3b8da3cf4f135c678291e1c144",
      "text": "行为曾受到行政处分的情形。此时，期间的计算以就该违法行为"
    },
    {
      "id": "A39478-zh-00006",
      "source_hash": "483264d4a6a9c6e56ecbd680fe3a153e7364a33fdf3e8e2e075ed776622aa9f5",
      "text": "受到行政处分之日及该处分后再次实施相同违法行为而被"
    },
    {
      "id": "A39478-zh-00007",
      "source_hash": "e6b64059621ba61041b99dfc0761da99de5e5ac2e77d87938ea5a9d2e08079e5",
      "text": "查获之日为准。"
    },
    {
      "id": "A39478-zh-00008",
      "source_hash": "28427a9884ed513dd4321efe166cf34c52bfab835193a1e9c6d06ad75605857e",
      "text": "乙. 依据甲目加重处分时，加重处分的适用次数为该次违法"
    },
    {
      "id": "A39478-zh-00009",
      "source_hash": "7a63df69f03667864b6b9b0de270e6f97f6261577e195f29e6b937f9f9f47c0e",
      "text": "行为之前的处分次数（甲目所定期间内有两次以上行政处分时，"
    },
    {
      "id": "A39478-zh-00010",
      "source_hash": "71756296611284f3c1f665df5f50ed9ad628948ede6569451d97728ae313dd9f",
      "text": "以其中较高次数为准）的下一次数。"
    },
    {
      "id": "A39478-zh-00011",
      "source_hash": "8bd6cbe9d8c459f5a2383d0dd81e827f8f089d30257264eb033f3222df587562",
      "text": "丙. 有两项以上违法行为且各自适用的处分标准不同时，"
    },
    {
      "id": "A39478-zh-00012",
      "source_hash": "704f650bf3b22e01e2061ef30aff32a8055aee693acbef57e01d85bf8d00a097",
      "text": "适用其中较重的处分标准。但两项以上处分标准均为停止业务处分时，"
    },
    {
      "id": "A39478-zh-00013",
      "source_hash": "75447d5a0060bd0ed9f9400eabb683a2eccac0c26f786b4762302f58d90679de",
      "text": "在不超过各项处分标准期间合计的范围内，可以在较重的"
    },
    {
      "id": "A39478-zh-00014",
      "source_hash": "422abba91038f90ce89b0fc4b5ac3ae67f62fce1c02f25350d5d40cb55c3e194",
      "text": "处分标准二分之一的范围内加重处分。"
    },
    {
      "id": "A39478-zh-00015",
      "source_hash": "d8e74f1c81c50fbae8aeb3ce4c8fb406c451af3fa5b4822715a4a14cdfae9af0",
      "text": "丁. 有下列任一情形的，即使不符合第二项个别标准，仍可"
    },
    {
      "id": "A39478-zh-00016",
      "source_hash": "9f0a049ee8c679f7f9c8976ab571f71e3e3a0ed9a692ed4bbd94107a9bbae924",
      "text": "撤销指定。"
    },
    {
      "id": "A39478-zh-00017",
      "source_hash": "4da2ef47cbc635a586955df9916b8bd2df77a326c6058ae9ec3dc2a06696153f",
      "text": "1）对入住者的违法行为情节严重（如因故意或者重大过失实施违法行为，"
    },
    {
      "id": "A39478-zh-00018",
      "source_hash": "245bde985379092077142ee8f293577d7c9593df550887e0969545f853dc9418",
      "text": "并考虑违法程度、动机及结果等因素，"
    },
    {
      "id": "A39478-zh-00019",
      "source_hash": "09b4b198067643fa19e21220deaac745a4e574e8555f7c5afe10fd7c6e93b5c1",
      "text": "认为有必要加重处分标准），"
    },
    {
      "id": "A39478-zh-00020",
      "source_hash": "c7822e7bb8a74ecd4d31061f77a53254e18c0b8c6d339d67f2f7e7cb21f9b930",
      "text": "致使支援设施无法正常运营的。"
    },
    {
      "id": "A39478-zh-00021",
      "source_hash": "bd01fe4cc2c6bf9fa950401fd0464a12cb4ae775d82871292819cf999536e72d",
      "text": "2）存在三项以上违法行为，且属于下列任一情形的："
    },
    {
      "id": "A39478-zh-00022",
      "source_hash": "cc5750c3de79f92ba91e370922fade6d1325f3a10850cc12d62118a63b4fa804",
      "text": "甲）违法行为种类达到四种以上。"
    },
    {
      "id": "A39478-zh-00023",
      "source_hash": "b3cbdc103dc5d05aae0ec65788f0a6dfe4ace29b3552e7b0b805cb32142f7fa2",
      "text": "乙）全部违法行为均属于第二十五条第一款第四项规定的情形。"
    },
    {
      "id": "A39478-zh-00024",
      "source_hash": "643e75577c2beea14cf395c9b50b9031ed06dff8262bd1e99d3687180eb78064",
      "text": "戊. 单一违法行为应受到停止业务处分时，有下列任一情形的，"
    }
  ],
  "note": "Compared administrative disposition standards source across fragmented cells; restored three-year lookback, order of escalating penalties, maximum half of heavier suspension standard without exceeding sum, discretionary revocation and violation thresholds. Row 2 retained."
}